      "message": "We cannot rebase the update to Jetty 11 in Id07447f8745e89896f2ea92e27bfb77d87f6c608\nonto gerrit master since master depends on a new method\n`org.eclipse.jgit.patch.PatchApplier.Result.Error.isGitConflict()`\nwhich was introduced on jgit master after JGit was updated to jetty 12 on the next branch:\nhttps://eclipse.gerrithub.io/c/eclipse-jgit/jgit/+/1195305/4/org.eclipse.jgit/src/org/eclipse/jgit/patch/PatchApplier.java\n\njava/com/google/gerrit/server/restapi/change/CreateChange.java:489: error: invalid method reference\n          hasGitConflicts \u003d applyResult.getErrors().stream().anyMatch(Error::isGitConflict);\n                                                                      ^\n  cannot find symbol\n    symbol:   method isGitConflict(T)\n    location: class Error\n  where T is a type-variable:\n    T extends Object declared in interface Stream\n\nThere is no JGit commit which uses jetty 11 and has this new method.\nHence we need to squash the gerrit updates to jetty 11 and 12.",
